        "original_id": "ae452390-0772-5cec-afd8-01bf8f1bc0d2",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dubai Media City, Dubai, United Arab Emirates, New York City\n- Buildings: Business Central Towers, Chrysler Building, Empire State Building\n\nFacts:\n- The Business Central Towers is a complex of two 53-floor towers in Dubai Media City in Dubai, United Arab Emirates.\n- Both Business Central Towers have an equal structural height of 265 m.\n- The Business Central Towers resemble New York City's Chrysler Building.\n- The Chrysler Building is 318.9 m tall.\n- In 1931, the Empire State Building surpassed the Chrysler Building after the Chrysler Building had been the world's tallest building for 11 months.",
